left;\">免费配镜后，支持 7 天无理由免费试用。</p><p data-vmark=\"d9cd\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/af1f2023-3c98-435d-99f2-2762bfd09af4.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"466\" h=\"103\" data-weibo=\"0\" data-vmark=\"78f7\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"51f5\" style=\"text-align: left;\">支持保价 11.11，支持 11 月 13 日前如果降价，可联系客服保价。</p><h2 data-vmark=\"7800\">京东免费配镜</h2><p data-vmark=\"6e76\">活动时间：10 月 22 日付款的订单</p><p data-vmark=\"2587\">参与商品：雷鸟 GT Max、GT</p><p data-vmark=\"e93a\">参与方式：拍下主机订单后联系客服发配镜链接，拍下配镜服务订单，提供准确验光参数，商家按参数加工制作眼镜并发货（仅限品牌配镜，非自营配镜）。</p><p data-vmark=\"9bb8\">退款说明：确认收货后，联系客服申请退还配镜款项。</p><p data-vmark=\"35ea\">配镜范围：支持近视 1000 度以内 / 散光 50-200 度，如果超出范围可以补 100 额外定制哦。</p><p data-vmark=\"4539\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/328bbd5a-32d4-4bb1-b4e1-f7533c5862c7.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"910\" h=\"425\" data-weibo=\"1\" data-vmark=\"df42\" class=\"no-alt-img\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/3c262a3d-26e2-4f5b-ab68-b8bb6d18f759.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"875\" h=\"1015\" data-weibo=\"2\" data-vmark=\"8150\" class=\"no-alt-img\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/04b3d4f5-8aa9-46bf-a31f-5330153d58f7.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"899\" h=\"1074\" data-weibo=\"3\" data-vmark=\"38b6\" class=\"no-alt-img\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/3664103a-d1cc-4e3a-92b9-c9af86dcddb3.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"910\" h=\"735\" data-weibo=\"4\" data-vmark=\"e7cc\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/eaghPCI\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eggFS6a\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/ergfvR6\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eggmZnu\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/eggxknd\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eGgxcqs\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eage2iv\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252feOgmIjS%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-itwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/e1gjcCA\" data-lpwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eDgeUZv\"   data-ncid=\"262173\"><span class=\"card main-site\"><span class=\"card-logo\"><img src=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/442820/23/12355/39554/6a1d54f3F59b5bd26/0083320320111f4b.png\" w=\"800\" h=\"800\"></span><span class=\"card-info\"><span class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"mall-data\">京东</span><span class=\"card-name\">雷鸟 RayNeo GT 智能眼镜</span></span><span class=\"card-abstract\">免费配镜</span><span class=\"card-controls\"><span class=\"price\"> 1339 元返 100 元</span><span class=\"card-btn-deep\">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p data-vmark=\"7d6f\">京东 11.11 红包至高 26888 元无门槛可用，每天可抽一次：<a href=\"https://u.jd.com/eggckW5\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eDgjO1K\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eOg5cGl\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/e1gRxhZ\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/5DPV3s8\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eOgk7hp\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/eOgoLSl\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fe6gF9Ik%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-ncid=\"262173\"><strong>点此抽取</strong></a>。</p>",
